%      docs/related-work.md (which records surnames only).  Surnames there were all correct;
%      first names were simply absent, which was the actual defect this item existed to fix.
%   4. Names are written "Last, First" throughout so BibTeX cannot mis-split compound given
%      names -- e.g. "Lubana, Ekdeep Singh" and "Ying, Zhuofan Josh" would otherwise have their
%      middle names promoted into the surname.
%
% RESULT: 18/18 IDs resolve.  18/18 titles match.  0 fabricated citations.  0 wrong-paper hits.
